00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:21.130
to organize shoes for less $100.

00:00:21.130 --> 00:00:22.030
What is it?

00:00:22.030 --> 00:00:27.030
- So we have created shoe
storage cubbies out of PVC pipes.

00:00:27.362 --> 00:00:30.530
Literally six inch PVC pipes,

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:32.670
wrapped them creatively with wallpaper,

00:00:32.670 --> 00:00:35.550
again, stick on wallpaper,
to give you this look.

00:00:35.550 --> 00:00:37.480
What's fantastic about it is

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:39.720
whether you're in an apartment
or you're in a big house,

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:41.950
no one can ever have enough storage.

00:00:41.950 --> 00:00:44.340
So you can make this as large as you want,

00:00:44.340 --> 00:00:46.920
just add more, as small
as you want, as high,

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:48.920
you can even do abstract designs with it

00:00:48.920 --> 00:00:50.420
because look at this.

00:00:50.420 --> 00:00:51.430
They don't move!

00:00:52.290 --> 00:00:54.610
